      "translation": "One day, Sun Wukong saw a big bear in the forest. He was scared!",
      "translations": [
        "One day, Sun Wukong saw a big bear in the forest. He was scared!",
        "He took his magic stick out of his ear. “Grow! Grow!” he said. The stick got very big!",
        "The bear ran away. Sun Wukong smiled. “I did it!” he said."
